      "text": "Eight partitions at up to 55 minutes is a both-windows job. XL is clear all Friday; Thursday only the day window \u2014 the night window is the month-end close.",
      "ts": "2026-03-09T08:52:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Femi Oyelaran",
      "text": "Nobody posts a closed-period entry instead of the rebuild unless Corin and I sign it together. Rebuild it properly.",
